   "text": "## The level it is heading for, in dB: the deepest dip in force, or SILENCE\n## while it fades out.\nfunc target_db() -> float:\n\tif _fading_out:\n\t\treturn SILENCE\n\tvar level := 0.0\n\tfor db: float in _dips.values():\n\t\tlevel = minf(level, db)\n\treturn level"
